1
00:01:37,632 --> 00:01:41,988
Behind the church the people cheer,

2
00:01:47,104 --> 00:01:51,895
I play my organ, loud and clear.

3
00:01:56,799 --> 00:02:01,808
I send my voice into the night,

4
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:15,354
To bring my lioness in sight.

5
00:02:15,459 --> 00:02:24,628
I sang my heart out to the sky,

6
00:02:24,971 --> 00:02:34,136
To watch my last devotion die!

7
00:02:34,509 --> 00:02:43,251
I gave you all my burning light,

8
00:02:44,252 --> 00:02:55,896
And now you push me in the night!

9
00:03:13,604 --> 00:03:18,538
And then I see her white dress shine,

10
00:03:23,127 --> 00:03:27,838
A surge of joy, she must be mine!

11
00:03:32,608 --> 00:03:38,360
She heard my call, she turned around,

12
00:03:42,371 --> 00:03:50,767
Our broken pack is healed and found!

13
00:03:50,809 --> 00:03:55,564
I look again and freeze in space,

14
00:03:55,692 --> 00:04:00,305
Another boy is in my place.

15
00:04:00,352 --> 00:04:04,961
Her fingers touch his hand so sweet,

16
00:04:05,068 --> 00:04:12,735
She laughs at me in cold defeat.

17
00:04:30,426 --> 00:04:38,898
The demon whispers in my head:

18
00:04:39,493 --> 00:04:48,115
You were the temporary instead!

19
00:04:48,796 --> 00:04:58,539
He kicks the lion in his cage,

20
00:04:58,612 --> 00:05:17,372
And locks the door in bitter rage!

